{
  "dom_id": "step-t14956",
  "name": "Finding the Total Variance",
  "problem": "To find the total variance in terms of singular values, define the change of variables $Y = XV.$ The covariance of $Y$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{C}_{Y}=\\frac{1}{n-1}{Y}^{T}Y=\\frac{1}{n-1}(XV)^{T}(XV)={V}^{T}{{(\\frac{1}{n-1}{X}^{T}X)}_{⏟}}_{{C}_{X}}V.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $V$ contains the eigenvectors of $C_X,$ the matrix $C_Y$ is diagonal and contains the eigenvalues $\\lambda_i$ of $C_X{:}$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14215612/assets/c6bc16470cbbcba465827ffd9ac2926243757928afa659abcf1b1058f38071c1.svg)\n\nThe total variance is defined as the trace (sum of diagonal elements) of the covariance matrix. A key property of the trace is that it is invariant under orthogonal transformations like $Y=XV.$ Therefore, the total variance of $Y$ is the same as the total variance of $X{:}$\n\n$$\n\\textrm{Total Variance} = \\text{Tr}(C_X) = \\text{Tr}(C_Y) = \\sum_{i=1}^m \\lambda_i.\n$$\n\nSubstituting $\\lambda_i = \\frac{\\sigma_i^2}{n-1},$ we conclude that the total variance is *proportional to* the sum of the squared singular values:\n\n$$\n\\bbox[4pt,border: 1px solid lightgray]{\\textrm{Total Variance} \\:\\propto\\: \\sum_{i=1}^m \\sigma^2_i.}\n$$\n\nLet's see an example.",
  "worked_solution": "",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-t14956\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block;\">\n    \n               \n                <div class=\"tutorial\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">Finding the Total Variance</span></div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"t14956\">?</div>\n                    </div>                    \n    \n                    <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\n                            transition: none;\n                            -webkit-transiti